 are committed as Ruruka Ando struggles to survive and the traitor is close to being revealed. Monaca Towa's prophecy comes true when Kyoko Kirigiri's NG code is violated, because of Makoto Naegi.\n\nTo bring an end to this dreadful game of despair, Kyosuke Munakata decides it's time to decide whose hope is better: his or Makoto's.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-09-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lkEOxvQpQkAvdYultEEDOHbzlmz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lkEOxvQpQkAvdYultEEDOHbzlmz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/49471/season/2/episode/9"},{"id":"1408874","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Morte, Distruzione, Disperazione","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Following Kyoko Kirigiri's death, Makoto Naegi resolves to bring an end to the Final Killing Game and clashes with Kyosuke Munakata, fighting for whose hope is stronger.\n\nHowever, a recent, shocking revelation about Chisa Yukizome has driven Kyosuke into insanity and despair.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-09-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fyvDUBWdO6zBB2z7sluS8YJHPEg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fyvDUBWdO6zBB2z7sluS8YJHPEg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/49471/season/2/episode/10"},{"id":"1408875","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Tutte Buone Cose","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Leaving behind her notebook, Kyoko Kirigiri reveals the truth behind the Final Killing Game, leaving Makoto Naegi to test out his late friend's theory, only to be shocked by what he sees.\n\nMeanwhile, Juzo Sakakura decides to bring an end to this dreaded game in order to save Kyosuke Munakata.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2016-09-19","langua